The continuity 2024 row equals the registered 2024 result value for value (the builder
checks it): {{ext:comparisons/[id=uts_fixed_formula_adaptation_atp_2024]/paired_log_loss/alcaraz_minus_external|s4}}
{{ext:comparisons/[id=uts_fixed_formula_adaptation_atp_2024]/paired_log_loss/primary_95_interval|ci4}} on {{ext:comparisons/[id=uts_fixed_formula_adaptation_atp_2024]/cohort/matches|int}} matches.
UTS is not run on 2017–2023: those seasons lie in the formula's weight-tuning window,
predate its code or would need a new timing exclusion (design amendment A2).

## Ingram's Bayesian point model

The unchanged paper model, fitted for 2025 with the accepted settings and the 2024 seeds;
its raw posterior forecast is scored.

### Frozen model (primary)

| Block | Matches | Alcaraz | Ingram | Alcaraz − Ingram | 95% interval, eight-week blocks |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 2024 | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2024/n|int}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2024/incumbent/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2024/external_ingram_raw_posterior/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2024/incumbent_minus_external_log_loss|s4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2024/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} |
| 2025 | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2025/n|int}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2025/incumbent/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2025/external_ingram_raw_posterior/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2025/incumbent_minus_external_log_loss|s4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/2025/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} |
| 2024–2025 pooled | {{ui25:ingram/primary/pooled_2024_2025/n|int}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/pooled_2024_2025/incumbent/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/pooled_2024_2025/external_ingram_raw_posterior/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/pooled_2024_2025/incumbent_minus_external_log_loss|s4}} | {{ui25:ingram/primary/pooled_2024_2025/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} |

### Accepted version (continuity)

| Block | Matches | Alcaraz | Ingram | Alcaraz − Ingram | 95% interval, eight-week blocks |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 2024 | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2024/n|int}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2024/incumbent/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2024/external_ingram_raw_posterior/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2024/incumbent_minus_external_log_loss|s4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2024/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} |
| 2025 | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2025/n|int}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2025/incumbent/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2025/external_ingram_raw_posterior/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2025/incumbent_minus_external_log_loss|s4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/2025/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} |
| 2024–2025 pooled | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/pooled_2024_2025/n|int}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/pooled_2024_2025/incumbent/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/pooled_2024_2025/external_ingram_raw_posterior/log_loss|f4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/pooled_2024_2025/incumbent_minus_external_log_loss|s4}} | {{ui25:ingram/continuity/pooled_2024_2025/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} |

The continuity 2024 log losses equal the registered 2024 result (the builder checks them).
The registered interval, {{ing:primary/incumbent_minus_ingram_log_loss|s4}}
{{ing:primary/uncertainty/results/8/percentile_95|ci4}} on {{ing:primary/incumbent/n|int}} matches, came from
the Ingram run's own bootstrap; the intervals here come from this page's common scorer, so the
2024 interval differs slightly while the points agree.

**How the 2025 fit ran.** The first attempt finished sampling and passed the frozen gates in
every period, then stopped in the prediction step on one match-probability draw that floating-point
rounding had put a hair above one. The second attempt continued from the saved samples with the
frozen seeds, clipping probabilities within {{ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/1/tolerance|e0}} of the boundary and
recording each clip: {{ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/1/clipped_above_one + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/1/clipped_below_zero + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/2/clipped_above_one + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/2/clipped_below_zero + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/3/clipped_above_one + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/3/clipped_below_zero + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/4/clipped_above_one + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/4/clipped_below_zero + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/5/clipped_above_one + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/5/clipped_below_zero + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/6/clipped_above_one + ui25:ingram/run_2025/rounding_clips_by_period/6/clipped_below_zero|word}} clips in all, all in best-of-five matches
according to design amendment A5, which names them. The
{{ui25:ingram/run_2025/periods_reproduced_byte_for_byte|len|word}} periods without a clip that were
checked before the freeze reproduced their forecasts byte for byte from the saved samples.
Model, sampler, seeds, gates, inputs and scoring are unchanged.

## Limits

- A public-data formula adaptation, not the UTS website's historical output or its private
  database.
- No claim of prospective validity, betting value or universal state of the art.
- The 2024–2025 blocks share 2024 with the registered result and are not an independent
  confirmation.
